  "summary_md": "**vLLM ([@vllm_project](https://x.com/vllm_project/status/2115824393150701711))** announces day-0 vLLM support for **Mistral Large 4**, a 1T multimodal MoE with 1M context, FP8 and NVFP4 checkpoints and a built-in DSpark drafter giving roughly 2× output throughput; the thread adds low/medium/high reasoning effort, Pixtral multi-image vision, SkyRL RL support, cross-layer KV sharing and disaggregated serving ([weights](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-Large-4-1T-A52B), [NVFP4](https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-Large-4-1T-A52B-NVFP4), [blog](https://vllm.ai/blog/2026-10-29-mistral-large-4)).",
